#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:38(None)
msgid "@@image: 'images/menus/layer-stack.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"
msgstr "@@image: 'images/menus/layer-stack.png'; md5=THIS FILE DOESN'T EXIST"

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:22(quote) src/menus/layer/stack.xml:27(tertiary)
#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:30(primary) src/menus/layer/stack.xml:34(quote)
#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:68(quote)
msgid "Stack"
msgstr "Stack"

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:22(phrase)
msgid "<placeholder-1/> Submenu"
msgstr "Undermenyn <placeholder-1/>"

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:34(phrase)
msgid "The <placeholder-1/> submenu"
msgstr "Undermenyn <placeholder-1/>"

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:42(para)
msgid ""
"The layer stack is simply the list of layers in the Layers dialog. The "
"<guimenu>Stack</guimenu> submenu contains operations which either select a "
"new layer as the active layer, or change the position of the active layer in "
"the layer stack. If your image has only one layer, these commands are grayed "
"out."
msgstr ""
"Lagerstacken är helt enkelt listan över lager i dialogrutan Lager. Undermenyn "
"<guimenu>Stack</guimenu> innehåller åtgärder som antingen väljer ett nytt lager "
"som aktivt lager eller ändrar det aktiva lagrets plats i lagerstacken. Om bilden "
"bara har ett lager är kommandona nedtonade."

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:55(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this submenu from the image menubar through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Layer</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stack</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kommer åt undermenyn från bildens menyrad via <menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Stack</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/layer/stack.xml:71(para)
msgid ""
"The <guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu> submenu contains the following commands:"
msgstr "Undermenyn <guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu> innehåller följande kommandon:"

#: src/menus/layer/stack-reverse.xml:10(title)
msgid "The <quote>Reverse Layer Order</quote> command"
msgstr "Kommandot <quote>Omvänd lagerordning</quote>"

#: src/menus/layer/stack-reverse.xml:15(tertiary)
msgid "Reverse layer order"
msgstr "Omvänd lagerordning"

#: src/menus/layer/stack-reverse.xml:18(para)
msgid "This command is self-explanatory."
msgstr "Detta kommando är självförklarande."

#: src/menus/layer/stack-reverse.xml:21(title)
msgid "Activating the command"
msgstr "Aktivera kommandot"

#: src/menus/layer/stack-reverse.xml:24(para)
msgid ""
"From the image Menu through: <menuchoice><guimenu>Layers</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Reverse Layer Order</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Från bildmenyn via: <menuchoice><guimenu>Lager</guimenu><guisubmenu>Stack</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Omvänd lagerordning</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

